 "description": "<p>Ilulissat Airport (Greenlandic: Mittarfik Ilulissat, Danish: Ilulissat Lufthavn) (IATA: JAV, ICAO: BGJN) is an airport located near the shores of Disko Bay, 1.5 NM (2.8 km; 1.7 mi) north-east of Ilulissat, a town in the Qaasuitsup municipality in western Greenland. It was built in 1983, replacing the old heliport. Source: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ilulissat_Airport\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a></p>",
